{"4275120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "栀子花", "steam_appid": 4275120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game plot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will take on the role of a police officer who has just returned home from leave. While spending time at home with his daughter and watching what she does, he recalls the case he handled before coming home—a case that leaves him deep in thought...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4275120/extras/00edc04d00084e360a5729de83a5adc9.avif?t=1775209181\" width=482 height=308 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is primarily a narrative-driven story game. There isn’t much puzzle-solving in the main storyline, allowing players to fully immerse themselves in the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also includes some unique mini-games hidden among various NPCs in the story, which players can explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story experience of this game lasts about two hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game’s artistic scenes feature a unique pixel art style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also uses distinctive pixel character illustrations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story that might leave a lasting impression on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4275120/extras/e014f3b16006152585a46f8130239a21.avif?t=1775209181\" width=799 height=398 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a